# Fixtures are byte-exact by design: several of them exist precisely to carry
# CRLF line endings (COR-006, E10), invalid UTF-8 (COR-005, E11) or a byte
# order mark (E17). Any end-of-line normalisation on checkout or commit would
# destroy the thing being tested, so disable it for the whole tree.
testdata/** -text

# The corpus manifest is regenerated by `make corpus` and diffed as text.
bench/corpus-v1.json text eol=lf
